  "releaseNotes": "'## [10.3.0-prerelease.2](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.3.0-prerelease.1...v10.3.0-prerelease.2) (2026-02-25)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **reconciler:** prevent unnecessary updates when auto-attaching finalizers ([#1057](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1057)) ([0bf2017](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/0bf2017ad0b5089b1030e309a5ab796a595d77b3)), closes [#1001](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1001)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **test:** update dependency kubernetesclient to v19 ([#1056](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1056)) ([5f3d510](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/5f3d51021be3be219ad357c62494c80205acb322))\n* **test:** update dependency microsoft.net.test.sdk to 18.3.0 ([#1055](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1055)) ([0f42179](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/0f42179d5d96f568c54cf69673924dce531d5152))\n\n### Documentation\n\n* clarify webhook naming conventions in README ([#1050](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1050)) ([4b247de](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/4b247dedbf83821a04442c8650d6a07c3cb0e755)), closes [#1049](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1049)\n'",
